 "provenance": "Bavaria 9 (world 1, level index 8) normal exit 7,19, control-only on the exact S700 core. Start values: weaponTier 2 (hook, from the Bavaria 3 chest 24,25; Bavaria 4+ start with it), diving true (diving item from the Bavaria 8 riddle chest 20,12, which precedes Bavaria 9 in the campaign; the route swims through water three times (waterfall 26,4-26,3, right room 25,15-25,16, basin 20,20-24,24); without diving the replay is blocked at 25,4 at tick 790), maxHealth 4 (base), lives 12 (as the older campaign routes), diamonds 0 / redDiamonds 0 (the magic diamond lock tile at 8,19 is removed by the S700 loader, cGame case 12, so it never blocks). Route: stun snake 1,12 and pass; toggle the bridge network (switches 14,16 x2, 12,14, 15,13) up to checkpoint 1 (14,7); cut the grass column 14,3-6, collect top diamonds, cross the top-right room via row 4 and up the waterfall column 26,4->26,3 (mine 23,2 drops into the pool), cut grass 30,6 so mine 30,5 falls onto rubble 29-30,9; demo 6 and checkpoint 2 (30,11). Right room: cut grass 24,14 to release the column water, cut 26,12 so mine 26,11 falls into it and floats, step through grass 25,17 to drain the room (mine settles on 26,16), step through grass 28,17, hook the mine from 29,16 into column 28 where it falls onto rubble 28-29,20 and explodes; checkpoint 3 (25,23). Basin: hit switch 18,21 (bridge 21,21 opens, the drained room water floods the basin), cut grass 20,18 (pool water): mine 19,26 floats up to 19,24; step through grass 21,27 to drain into the crawler room (crawlers drown) and swim/run to 28,23 so the mine is 9 columns away and frozen while the water leaves; step back to 27,23: the mine falls two cells onto rubble 19,27 and explodes. Checkpoint 4 (16,29), gold key chest 13,27, step through grass 13,24 (to 14,24) so stone 13,23 drops to 13,26, climb out, open gold lock 9,18 (gate 9,19) and exit at 7,19. No damage taken, no deaths.",
